// ⚠️ THIS NOTE IS AT THE FILE END ON PURPOSE. A comment ABOVE the music shifts every
// source offset after it, so the whole book's data-pos moves and its snapshot has to be
// re-based -- a diff that proves nothing and hides the next real one. Below the music,
// nothing moves (measured: suite green with these notes, 10 snapshots red without).
// ✔ VERIFIED TO GUARD, not assumed to (session 190): dropping the "alto"/"tenor" cases from MeasureCollector.ItemFactory's basePosition switch moved 5 of 219 fixtures, this one among them.
